  "ne28:0.4": "3. 2. 9. parivattano hārasampāto ",
  "ne28:1.1": "tattha katamo parivattano hārasampāto: ",
  "ne28:2.1": "“tasmā rakkhitacitta’ssa sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti gāthā. ",
  "ne28:2.2": "samathavipassanāya bhāvitāya nirodho phalaṃ pariññātaṃ dukkhaṃ samudayo pahīno maggo bhāvito paṭipakkhena. ",
  "ne28:2.3": "niyutto parivattano hārasampāto "
}
